Lineage complete. Eight iterations reached legal convergence at iteration 8 of 16.

**Result:** 12 open findings — 0 P0, 1 P1, 11 P2. Verdict CONDITIONAL.

The P1 is real: `semantic-shadow.ts:404` calls `embeddingCoverage()` with no argument, which reaches `getDb()` → `initDb()` and opens the daemon-owned skill-graph database read-write on the recommend path, contradicting the read-only invariant the same module states at `:170-172`.

